menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_VIDEO_SESSION
    bool "Enable video call and companionship session"
    default n
    help
        Runs the bounded video session state machine, enforces the guardian
        camera and microphone permission, keeps a child consent gate and ends a
        call immediately when a permission is revoked. The default policy keeps
        capture off until a guardian enables it, so an audio-only body never
        links the component.

endmenu
